          "metadata": {
            "name": "renderTile"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "RENDERTILE",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1773227923433",
          "id": "1773217724730",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1773217724731_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.STITCHSUGGESTEDNEXTSTEPOUTPUT.$output.result}}\n\nNon Negotiable/Strict Requirements-\nLanguage Quality: All user-visible text you generate (title, summary, justification, labels) must be grammatically correct, clear, and professional. Do not use slang, fragments, or awkward phrasing.\n\nRepresent the above data using a message list(one message per SR row). Use ONLY the data provided in the inputs above. Do NOT invent or infer missing fields.\n\nThe title of the Panel should follow this format- \"Top {{$context.$nodes.CALCULATEROWSTOSHOW.$output.result}} Stalled SRs requiring your attention\n\nPanel level summary and description should be null\n\nStrictly use the following format to display each row, you can correct any grammatical mistakes if any in the base data, make it user readable-\n\ntitle = <Title> (<ReferenceNumber>)\nsubtitle =<Subtitle>\nsummary = <Problem Description>.<Justification>(Do not leave justification empty, do not mention urgency score or stagnation score in justification, use clear plain language)\n\ntimestamp=<timestamp>\n\nAdd a badge for each row-<Severity>, use appropriate color for badge color\nset priority to <priority>\n\nAdd an additionalAction to each row- ora.Invoke(\"takeAction\", <payload>)\n\nThe payload must include objectNumber, actionType, and the action-specific payload fields. actionType must be one of ['AssignToQueue','AssignToTeam','SendReminder'].\n\nthe label for the the action button should be <labelforSuggestedNextStep>\n\n\nOutside the widget, add actionableInsights for each item which is marked isCritical=\"Y\" and severity=\"high\", (oraInsight):  command \"ora. Invoke(\"takeAction\",<payload>)\", titled <Title>(<ReferenceNumber>), subtitle- <Justification> make it high priority, actionText = <labelforSuggestedNextStep>\n\nReturn only messageListWidget, no extra text."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "generateSummary"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "GENERATESUMMARY",
          "id": "1773229084209",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1773229084210_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.STITCHSUGGESTEDNEXTSTEPOUTPUT.$output.result}}\n\nSR count- {{$context.$nodes.CALCULATEROWSTOSHOW.$output.result}} \n\nBased on data above provide a short interpretive explanation produce a single operational summary for a manager:\n18–25 words total, for why these SRs were surfaced.\nREQUIREMENTS (must all be met)\n18–25 words\nMust reference the overall stalled SR count\nShould explain why the displayed SRs require attention\nMust remain operational rather than analytical \nIF there is no data, return blank output (empty string). Do not generate a summary.\nLanguage Quality: All user-visible text you generate must be grammatically correct, clear, and professional. Do not use slang, fragments, or awkward phrasing.\n\nuse ONLY the data provided above (do not invent any facts), \n\nMust reference the overall stalled SR count as provided in the input data (do not guess; if not explicitly present, do not fabricate a number).\nMust explain why the displayed SRs require attention (use only fields present critical flag, severity, waiting status, justification).\nMust remain operational rather than analytical (no trends, root-cause speculation, forecasting, or performance conclusions).\nOutput must be a single sentence or two short sentences, plain text only (no bullets, no JSON, no labels).\nDo not include any additional commentary.\nWORDING CONSTRAINTS (anti-hallucination)\nDo not use the term stagnation score, urgency score\n\nOnly mention attributes that are explicitly present in the SR data (e.g., “critical”, “high severity”, “waiting”).\nDo not mention customers, revenue, SLA breach, product impact, or escalations unless explicitly stated in the provided SR titles/descriptions/justifications.\nReturn only the summary text (or blank if no data)."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "mergeOutput",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "let str =\n  ($context.$nodes.DISPLAYUPDATEMESSAGE?.$output?.result || \"\") +\n  ($context.$nodes.DISPLAYMESSAGE?.$output?.result || \"\") +\n  ($context.$nodes.DISPLAYSENDREMINDERMESSAGE?.$output?.result || \"\");\n\nreturn str.trim();"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1774500835551"
          },
          "code": "MERGEOUTPUT",
          "id": "1773380217660",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "formActionSystemMessage",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const actionData = JSON.parse($context.$app.$OraAction || \"{}\");\nconst action = actionData.actionType;\nconst srNumber = actionData.objectNumber;\nlet summary = \"\";\n\nif (action === \"AssignToQueue\") {\n  const queue = $context.$nodes.BUILDUPDATESRPAYLOAD.$output.result?.Queue || \"the selected queue\";\n  summary = `Assigned SR ${srNumber} to queue ${queue}`;\n} else if (action === \"AssignToTeam\") {\n  const agent = $context.$nodes.BUILDADDTOTEAMPAYLOAD.$output.result?.AgentName || \"the selected agent\";\n  summary = `Added ${agent} to SR ${srNumber} team`;\n} else if (action === \"SendReminder\") {\n  const agent = $context.$nodes.BUILDSENDREMINDERPAYLOAD.$output.result?.AgentName || \"the assigned agent\";\n  summary = `Sent a reminder for SR ${srNumber} to ${agent}`;\n}\n\nconst obj = {\n  output: {\n    Summary: summary\n  },\n  workflowCode: \"SERVICE_REQUEST_STALL_MANAGEMENT_ADVISOR_RA\",\n  ActionTaken: action\n};\n\nreturn JSON.stringify(obj);"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1774500910482"
          },
          "code": "FORMACTIONSYSTEMMESSAGE",
          "id": "1774500835551",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
