          "code": "PREPAREPRIORTIZESRSINPUT",
          "id": "1776785319274",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "priortizeSRs"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1776785363568"
          },
          "code": "PRIORTIZESRS",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1774272715183",
          "id": "1771397318931",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771397318932_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are evaluating Service Requests (SRs) that have already been identified as stalled in execution.\n\nINPUT DATA (authoritative; use only this)\n{{$context.$nodes.PREPAREPRIORTIZESRSINPUT.$output.result}}\n\nNON-NEGOTIABLE CONSTRAINTS\nDo NOT reassess whether they are stalled.\nDo NOT introduce new Service Requests.\nDo NOT assume facts not present in the data.\nDo NOT modify eligibility.\nDo NOT recompute stagnation scores.\nDo NOT question the deterministic selection logic.\nDo NOT use any external knowledge or make inferences beyond the provided fields.\nLanguage Quality: All user-visible text you generate must be grammatically correct, clear, and professional.\nDo NOT fabricate missing values. If a required output field cannot be supported from the input, return null.\nPreserve ReferenceNumber exactly as provided.\n\nYour task is to prioritize the provided SRs for managerial attention due to execution stagnation.\n\nUse only these fields from each SR:\nReferenceNumber\nStagnation Score\nCritical Flag\nSeverity\nStatusType\nTitle\nProblem Description\nSubtitle\naccountScore\n\nYour objective is to determine the top {{$context.$nodes.CALCULATEROWSTOSHOW.$output.result}} Service Requests requiring the most immediate managerial intervention.\n\nPRIORITIZATION RULES (Apply strictly in this order of influence)\n1. Higher Stagnation Score increases urgency.\n2. Critical Flag = Y significantly increases urgency.\n3. High Severity increases urgency.\n4. SRs in waiting status indicate blocked execution and increase urgency.\n5. Problem descriptions indicating:\n- operational blockage\n- customer dissatisfaction\n- delivery delay\n- business or production impact\n- escalation likelihood\nincrease urgency.\n6. When differences are marginal, use Stagnation Score as the tie-breaker.\n\nREQUIRED OUTPUT FOR EACH INCLUDED SR\nAssign:\nUrgency Score (integer between 1 and 100)\nPrimary Concern Category (choose exactly ONE, and use this exact keyword) from this list-[High Business Impact,Severe Stagnation,Regression Risk,Customer Escalation Risk,Mixed Factors]\nJustification (2-3 sentences maximum): write in plain operational language for a manager; do NOT mention or reference internal scoring metrics such as \"Urgency Score\", \"Stagnation Score\", or any numeric ranking; justify only using StatusType, Severity, Critical Flag, explicit signals in Problem Description, or clear operational risk or delay described in the SR.\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT (strict)\nReturn a JSON array only.\nSort the array from highest Urgency Score to lowest.\nReturn exactly {{$context.$nodes.CALCULATEROWSTOSHOW.$output.result}} items if at least that many SRs are provided; otherwise return all provided SRs.\nDo not include any commentary outside the JSON array.\nDo not echo input fields other than ReferenceNumber.\nEach object must follow this exact structure (keys must match exactly, including spaces and capitalization):\n\n{\n  \"ReferenceNumber\": \"<value>\",\n  \"Urgency Score\": <integer>,\n  \"Primary Concern Category\": \"<one of the allowed categories>\",\n  \"Justification\": \"<ShortJustification>\"\n}\n\nOnly return a json array."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "extractPriortizeSRsOutput",
            "returnType": "array",
            "sourceCode": "let raw = $context.$nodes.PRIORTIZESRS.$output;\n\nif (Array.isArray(raw)) {\n  raw = raw;\n} else if (raw && typeof raw === \"object\" && Array.isArray(raw.result)) {\n  raw = raw.result;\n} else if (typeof raw === \"string\") {\n  raw = raw.replace(/```json\\s*/i, \"\").replace(/```$/, \"\").trim();\n  raw = JSON.parse(raw);\n}\n\nif (!Array.isArray(raw)) {\n  throw new Error(\"Expected PRIORTIZESRS to return a JSON array.\");\n}\n\nreturn raw.map(item => ({\n  \"ReferenceNumber\": item.ReferenceNumber ?? null,\n  \"Urgency Score\": item[\"Urgency Score\"] ?? null,\n  \"Primary Concern Category\": item[\"Primary Concern Category\"] ?? null,\n  \"Justification\": item.Justification ?? null\n}));"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1773142141182"
          },
          "code": "EXTRACTPRIORTIZESRSOUTPUT",
          "id": "1776785363568",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "cleanseData",
            "returnType": "array",
            "sourceCode": "const baseRows = Array.isArray($context.$nodes.CONDENSEARRAY.$output?.result)\n  ? $context.$nodes.CONDENSEARRAY.$output.result\n  : [];\nconst generatedRows = Array.isArray($context.$nodes.EXTRACTPRIORTIZESRSOUTPUT.$output?.result)\n  ? $context.$nodes.EXTRACTPRIORTIZESRSOUTPUT.$output.result\n  : [];\n\nconst baseByReferenceNumber = new Map(\n  baseRows\n    .filter(item => item && item.ReferenceNumber != null)\n    .map(item => [String(item.ReferenceNumber), item])\n);\n\nreturn generatedRows\n  .map(item => {\n    const referenceNumber = item?.ReferenceNumber;\n    if (referenceNumber == null) {\n      return null;\n    }\n\n    const baseRow = baseByReferenceNumber.get(String(referenceNumber));\n    if (!baseRow) {\n      return null;\n    }\n\n    return {\n      ...baseRow,\n      \"Urgency Score\": item[\"Urgency Score\"] ?? null,\n      \"Primary Concern Category\": item[\"Primary Concern Category\"] ?? null,\n      \"Justification\": item.Justification ?? null\n    };\n  })\n  .filter(Boolean);"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1777374311387"
          },
          "code": "CLEANSEDATA",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1774272715183",
          "id": "1773142141182",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "prepareSuggestedNextStepInput",
            "returnType": "array",
            "sourceCode": "const currentRows = Array.isArray($context.$nodes.CLEANSEDATA.$output?.result)\n  ? $context.$nodes.CLEANSEDATA.$output.result\n  : [];\nconst top5ResolvedByReferenceNumber = $context.$variables.Top5ResolvedSRs || {};\n\nreturn currentRows.map(item => {\n  const referenceNumber = item?.ReferenceNumber ?? null;\n  const top5Data = referenceNumber != null\n    ? top5ResolvedByReferenceNumber[referenceNumber] || {}\n    : {};\n  const similarResolvedSRs = Array.isArray(top5Data.similarResolvedSRs)\n    ? top5Data.similarResolvedSRs.map(candidate => ({\n        srNumber: candidate?.srNumber ?? null,\n        title: candidate?.title ?? null,\n        problemDescription: candidate?.problemDescription ?? null,\n        queueName: candidate?.queueName ?? null,\n        queueId: candidate?.queueId ?? null,\n        assigneePersonName: candidate?.assigneePersonName ?? null,\n        assigneeResourceId: candidate?.assigneeResourceId ?? null\n      }))\n    : [];\n\n  return {\n    \"ReferenceNumber\": referenceNumber,\n    \"Title\": item?.Title ?? null,\n    \"Problem Description\": item?.[\"Problem Description\"] ?? null,\n    \"Assigned\": item?.Assigned ?? null,\n    \"PersonID\": item?.PersonID ?? null,\n    \"SrID\": item?.SrID ?? null,\n    \"similarResolvedCount\": top5Data.count ?? similarResolvedSRs.length,\n    \"similarResolvedSRs\": similarResolvedSRs\n  };\n});"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771398709995"
          },
          "code": "PREPARESUGGESTEDNEXTSTEPINPUT",
          "id": "1776786928300",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
