          "code": "SUGGESTEDNEXTSTEP",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1774272715183",
          "id": "1771398709995",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771398709998_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are selecting the next managerial action for each stalled Service Request (SR).\n\nINPUT DATA (authoritative; use only this)\n{{$context.$nodes.PREPARESUGGESTEDNEXTSTEPINPUT.$output.result}}\n\nEach item includes:\n- ReferenceNumber\n- Title\n- Problem Description\n- Assigned\n- PersonID\n- SrID\n- similarResolvedCount\n- similarResolvedSRs\n\nNON-NEGOTIABLE CONSTRAINTS\nDo NOT add or remove rows.\nDo NOT use external knowledge.\nDo NOT invent queue IDs, assignee IDs, assignee names, or labels.\nDo NOT modify the provided input values.\nUse only the data provided.\nIf an input field needed for a payload is missing, preserve it as null or an empty string instead of inventing a value.\n\nTASK\nFor each input row, decide exactly one next step from ['AssignToQueue','AssignToTeam','SendReminder'] and return only the generated fields listed below.\n\nDECISION RULES\n1. If similarResolvedCount < 3, choose SendReminder.\n2. Otherwise choose exactly one winner from similarResolvedSRs that is at least 70% similar to the current SR using only Title and Problem Description.\n3. If the winner has a valid queueName and queueId, choose AssignToQueue.\n4. Else if the winner's assigneePersonName equals Assigned, choose SendReminder.\n5. Else if the winner has a valid assigneePersonName and assigneeResourceId, choose AssignToTeam.\n6. Else choose SendReminder.\n7. A value is valid only if it is present, non-null, and not an empty string.\n\nPAYLOAD RULES\n- SendReminder payload: {\"objectNumber\": ReferenceNumber, \"actionType\":\"SendReminder\", \"msgPayload\":{\"PersonID\": PersonID, \"SrId\": SrID, \"AssigneeName\": Assigned}}\n- AssignToQueue payload: {\"objectNumber\": ReferenceNumber, \"actionType\":\"AssignToQueue\", \"srPayload\":{\"QueueId\": winner.queueId, \"QueueName\": winner.queueName}}\n- AssignToTeam payload: {\"objectNumber\": ReferenceNumber, \"actionType\":\"AssignToTeam\", \"resPayload\":{\"ObjectId\": winner.assigneeResourceId, \"AssigneeName\": winner.assigneePersonName}}\n\nLABEL RULES\n- SendReminder label: \"Send Reminder to [Assigned]\"\n- AssignToQueue label: \"Assign to [winner.queueName]\"\n- AssignToTeam label: \"Add [winner.assigneePersonName] to Team\"\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT (strict)\nReturn a JSON array only.\nReturn exactly one output object for each input item.\nPreserve the input order.\nEach object must follow this exact structure:\n{\n  \"ReferenceNumber\": \"<value>\",\n  \"suggestedNextStep\": \"<AssignToQueue|AssignToTeam|SendReminder>\",\n  \"payload\": <object>,\n  \"labelforSuggestedNextStep\": \"<label>\"\n}\n\nDo not include any extra commentary outside the JSON array."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "extractSuggestedNextStepOutput",
            "returnType": "array",
            "sourceCode": "let raw = $context.$nodes.SUGGESTEDNEXTSTEP.$output;\n\nif (Array.isArray(raw)) {\n  raw = raw;\n} else if (raw && typeof raw === \"object\" && Array.isArray(raw.result)) {\n  raw = raw.result;\n} else if (typeof raw === \"string\") {\n  raw = raw.replace(/```json\\s*/i, \"\").replace(/```$/, \"\").trim();\n  raw = JSON.parse(raw);\n}\n\nif (!Array.isArray(raw)) {\n  throw new Error(\"Expected SUGGESTEDNEXTSTEP to return a JSON array.\");\n}\n\nreturn raw.map(item => ({\n  \"ReferenceNumber\": item.ReferenceNumber ?? null,\n  \"suggestedNextStep\": item.suggestedNextStep ?? null,\n  \"payload\": item.payload ?? null,\n  \"labelforSuggestedNextStep\": item.labelforSuggestedNextStep ?? item.labelForSuggestedNextStep ?? null\n}));"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1776787008518"
          },
          "code": "EXTRACTSUGGESTEDNEXTSTEPOUTPUT",
          "id": "1776786992603",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "stitchSuggestedNextStepOutput",
            "returnType": "array",
            "sourceCode": "const baseRows = Array.isArray($context.$nodes.CLEANSEDATA.$output?.result)\n  ? $context.$nodes.CLEANSEDATA.$output.result\n  : [];\nconst generatedRows = Array.isArray($context.$nodes.EXTRACTSUGGESTEDNEXTSTEPOUTPUT.$output?.result)\n  ? $context.$nodes.EXTRACTSUGGESTEDNEXTSTEPOUTPUT.$output.result\n  : [];\n\nconst generatedByReferenceNumber = new Map(\n  generatedRows\n    .filter(item => item && item.ReferenceNumber != null)\n    .map(item => [String(item.ReferenceNumber), item])\n);\n\nreturn baseRows\n  .filter(item => item && item.ReferenceNumber != null)\n  .map(item => {\n    const generated = generatedByReferenceNumber.get(String(item.ReferenceNumber)) || {};\n\n    return {\n      ...item,\n      \"suggestedNextStep\": generated.suggestedNextStep ?? null,\n      \"payload\": generated.payload ?? null,\n      \"labelforSuggestedNextStep\": generated.labelforSuggestedNextStep ?? null\n    };\n  });"
          },
          "outcomes": {
